 "name": "Maximum: Black Hole",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/star-rage.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Virtual Mass Mastery</em></p>\n<p>As an action you can sacrifice yourself, becoming a Black Hole for 1 minute, after which you die. This creates a 100 foot radius of difficult terrain where all creatures within range make a Strength saving throw at the end of your turn, being pulled 50 feet closer on a failed save or 25 feet on a success. If a creature or object gets within 5 feet of you as a result of this forced movement, they are sucked into the black hole and die.</p>",
